        },
        "subject": "LU-18687 build: query pkg-config through $PKGCONF",
        "message": "LU-18687 build: query pkg-config through $PKGCONF\n\nconfigure.ac already finds pkg-config with AC_PATH_PROG() and\nstores it in $PKGCONF. Use it for the systemd and bash completion\nqueries, and add LB_CHECK_PKG() to replace PKG_CHECK_MODULES().\nThe pkg.m4 macros are found by aclocal, so this removes one use\nof the automake tools.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I4a8c58750a2526f32a618193682612256a6a6964\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
